        <name>Bind</name>
        <qualifiedname>AGE::NativeScriptComponent::Bind</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Binds a new scriptable entity type to the <ref refid="struct_a_g_e_1_1_native_script_component" kindref="compound">NativeScriptComponent</ref> system. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function sets up the necessary functions for creating and destroying instances of a specific scriptable entity type (T). The InstantiateScript lambda creates an instance of T, while DestroyScript deletes it. These lambdas are set based on the compiler used to compile the code. If the compiler is not recognized or supported by AGE yet, an error message will be shown.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>void </para>
